#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -Eeuo pipefail

# Roshdy V48 - Employee Performance accurate session mapping + cleaner presence wording
# Fixes:
# 1) Historical employee/extension mapping: one employee is treated as one active extension at a time.
#    If an old Extension Session was left open, its effective end becomes the next extension selection by the same employee.
# 2) Report aggregates by employee when the employee is known, not by extension only.
# 3) If no historical SIP presence samples exist, UI shows selected-extension duration or a dash, not confusing wording.
# 4) Rebuilds yesterday snapshot.
# Safety: no report_api.py edits, no Elastix writes, no CDR/AMI config edits, no log delete/compress/rotate.

